# Code owners (brief §F5; decision H-6; WP8).
#
# GitHub requests a review from these teams on every pull request that touches
# a matching path. Reviews are REQUIRED only if the protect-main ruleset turns
# on "Require review from Code Owners" (the H-6 review gate; see
# docs/SETUP-PRODUCTION.md §B4). A team must have write access to the repo for
# its entry to count. Pull request authors cannot approve their own PRs, so a
# maintainer who edits content needs a second maintainer (docs/HANDOVER.md §4).
#
# Replace "bobalab-berkeley" if the organization has another name. The last
# matching line wins.

# Everything: the web maintainers.
*                         @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers

# Content edited through Decap (cms/* branches): maintainers review what editors publish.
/content/                 @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
/public/uploads/          @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers

# Build, CI/CD, CMS configuration and the vendored Decap bundle.
/.github/                 @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
/public/admin/            @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
/cms/                     @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
/scripts/                 @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
/package.json             @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
/package-lock.json        @bobalab-berkeley/web-maintainers
